_INCOMPLETE_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The service card and the marked light are still available. Return when you can compare them.","delivery_nb":"Ingen innspilt stemme. Tekst p\u00e5 panelet eller i notatboken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"T02_BASELINE_RESULT","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Faktisk normalbaseline i feltfasen for en eldre sak, uten tilbakespoling til kveldsoverleveringen.","requires":{"all":["ctx_trafo_service_ok"],"none":["trafo_normal_checked"]},"direction_nb":"Kvitter bare den fysiske controllerens gyldige normalrecord. Bevar originalt tidspunkt og gamle kort. Ingen automatisk feltkonklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"T02_BASELINE_RESULT_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The completed service check and the inspection light now agree.","delivery_nb":"Ingen innspilt stemme. Tekst p\u00e5 panelet eller i notatboken."},{"id":"T02_BASELINE_RESULT_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The ordinary lamp complaint is resolved under this control. Keep the actual completion time on the inspection card.","delivery_nb":"Ingen innspilt stemme. Tekst p\u00e5 panelet eller i notatboken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"trafo_normal_checked":true,"field_service_read":true},"give_documents":["EV_TRAFO_CHECK"]}},{"id":"T02_REFERENCE","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Legg EV_DALE_NOTE eller kontaktarket ved kjent st\u00e5sted; hovedsporet krever ikke at hele VHS er sett.","requires":{"all":["office_evidence_taken","trafo_normal_checked"],"none":["field_reference_matched"]},"direction_nb":"Vis som kort unders\u00f8kelsestekst uten fortellerstemme. G\u00e5 tilbake til samme fysiske oppgave etterp\u00e5.","lines":[{"id":"T02_REFERENCE_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The culvert, the two white bands and the nearest pole match the reference sheet.","delivery_nb":"Ingen innspilt stemme. Tekst p\u00e5 panelet eller i notatboken."},{"id":"T02_REFERENCE_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The old photograph gives you a place to stand. It does not tell you which supply is carrying the light now.","delivery_nb":"Ingen innspilt stemme. Tekst p\u00e5 panelet eller i notatboken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"field_reference_matched":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"T02_CHECKS","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Etter at st\u00e5stedet er identifisert tilbyr panelet de separate fiktive kontrollene.","requires":{"all":["field_reference_matched"],"none":["trafo_anomaly_checked"]},"direction_nb":"Vis ikke korrektvalget f\u00f8r faktiske eksterne verdenstilstander er oppfylt. Spilleren f\u00e5r ikke selverkl\u00e6re testene gjennomf\u00f8rt ved \u00e5 velge en tekst.","lines":[{"id":"T02_CHECKS_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The service indication, the local control and the light must be compared as separate observations.","delivery_nb":"Ingen innspilt stemme. Tekst p\u00e5 panelet eller i notatboken."},{"id":"T02_CHECKS_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"A backup supply or a faulty indicator would be an ordinary explanation. Check those before drawing a conclusion.","delivery_nb":"Ingen innspilt stemme. Tekst p\u00e5 panelet eller i notatboken."}],"choices":[{"id":"T02_CH_VERIFIED","label":"File the observed disagreement after all checks.","next":"T02_VERIFIED","requires":{"all":["ctx_trafo_isolation_verified","ctx_trafo_backup_excluded","ctx_trafo_indicator_checked","ctx_trafo_lamp_persists","ctx_trafo_photo_available"],"none":[]},"on_select":{"set_flags":{},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"T02_CH_UNRESOLVED","label":"Keep this unresolved.","next":"T02_UNRESOLVED","requires":{"all":[],"none":[]},"on_select":{"set_flags":{},"give_documents":[]}}],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"T02_VERIFIED","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"choice","trigger_nb":"Kort konklusjon etter virkelig gje