TEXT(R"S47EV(vice front before requesting a check.","Open complaint: weak exterior inspection light. The observatory receiver is a separate system. This card is not an instruction to change receiver calibration.","The permitted service check has a visible response at the marked inspection light. Compare the completed panel result with that response. File an uncertain result as uncertain."],"production_nb":"Fiktivt servicekort ved trygg betjeningsfront utenfor avsperrede h\u00f8yspentdeler. Ikke tegn dette som en virkelig elektrisk koblingsinstruks."},{"id":"EV_TRAFO_CHECK","title":"Inspection card / completed local check","kind":"hand","stamp":"OPERATOR RECORD / CURRENT SHIFT","body":["Completed local service check: panel result and inspection light agreed after the ordinary complaint was handled.","Completion date and time: recorded from the actual check. Observed response retained with the service result.","This establishes the result of that check at that time. It is not a continuous record of every circuit throughout the night."],"production_nb":"Bare gis etter ctx_trafo_service_ok. Adapteren p\u00e5f\u00f8rer faktisk lokal dato og klokkeslett; feltet er ikke en fast 20:xx-gjetning."},{"id":"EV_TRAFO_FOLLOWUP","title":"Inspection card / later disagreement","kind":"hand","stamp":"FIELD FOLLOW-UP / CURRENT SHIFT","body":["Reference position matched against the retained field sheet. Local isolation checked; backup explanation excluded under the permitted control; panel indication compared against the independent service result.","The marked light continued its visible sequence. The result and the observation did not agree under these controls.","Cause unknown. Keep this with the normal inspection card and the reference sheet. Do not write a source or a distance that was not measured."],"production_nb":"Bare etter alle fire faktiske T02-verdensbetingelser. Tilf\u00f8y faktisk dato/klokkeslett og eget referansebilde ved lagring; aldri automatisk ved avspilling av VHS."}],"media":[],"strings":[{"id":"FIELD_UI_SERVICE","text":"Read the service card","context_nb":"Ved fysisk betjeningsfront."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_TEST","text":"Run the service check","context_nb":"Fiktiv kontroll; avvent virkelig resultat."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_WATCH","text":"Compare the result with the inspection light","context_nb":"Etter at testen er ferdig."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_LOG","text":"Keep the inspection card","context_nb":"N\u00e5r en datert kontroll finnes."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_REFERENCE","text":"Compare the reference position","context_nb":"Krever kontaktark eller hovednotat."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_BACKUP","text":"Check the local backup indication","context_nb":"En selvstendig kontroll i fiksjonen."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_INDICATOR","text":"Compare the independent service result","context_nb":"Kan ikke gj\u00f8res riktig bare ved \u00e5 trykke konklusjon."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_LEAVE","text":"Leave this unresolved","context_nb":"Gyldig avslutning uten hovedhistoriel\u00e5s."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_WAIT","text":"The check is still running.","context_nb":"Ingen automatisk suksess mens testen p\u00e5g\u00e5r."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_N01","text":"Compare the local records with the printout","context_nb":"Etter faktisk residual og med dokumenter tilgjengelige."},{"id":"FIELD_UI_NO_REFERENCE","text":"Keep a reference before deciding what changed.","context_nb":"Tilby datert referanse uten \u00e5 kreve et gammelt valgfritt matstopp."}]}]})S47EV")
;
